      "created_at": "2020-09-01T01:29:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Am I super late to the party in noticing this?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If this&nbsp;<em>isn't&nbsp;</em>a well-known thing that I'm just cluing in on now... check the artwork on p. 254 and 255 of the early access rules.&nbsp; Take a look at the people in line for the Helfyre show behind Rockstar - it's the cast of Vox Machina and the Mighty Nein.</p>\n<p>Very in keeping with the spirit of Sentinels, what with cameos from Team Fortress 2, Penny Arcade and elsewhere appearing in the card game.&nbsp; Now I wonder what other cameos are in the book art that I haven't noticed yet...</p>",
